### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Crm REST API — Generated
###
###  Start the server:
###    dotnet run --project path/to/project --urls "http://localhost:5201"
###
###  Then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────── Sites ────────────

### List sites for account
GET http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/hq

### Get site by id for account
GET http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/hq/1

### ──────────── Products ────────────

### List all products
GET http://localhost:5201/api/products

### Get product by Sku
GET http://localhost:5201/api/products/example-value

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:5201/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ListPrice": 0,
    "Name": "sample",
    "Sku": "example-sku"
}

### ──────────── Leads ────────────

### List all leads
GET http://localhost:5201/api/leads

### Get lead by Email
GET http://localhost:5201/api/leads/example-value

### Create a new lead
POST http://localhost:5201/api/leads
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Company": "sample",
    "Email": "example-email",
    "Name": "sample"
}

### Action: Convert
POST http://localhost:5201/api/leads/example-value/convert

### Action: Disqualify
POST http://localhost:5201/api/leads/example-value/disqualify

### ──────────── Accounts ────────────

### List all accounts
GET http://localhost:5201/api/accounts

### Get account by id
GET http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1

### Create a new account
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "Industry": "Technology",
    "Name": "sample"
}

### Action: PlaceHq
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/placeHq
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "city": "sample",
    "region": "sample"
}

### Action: AddContact
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/addContact
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "sample",
    "email": "sample"
}

### Action: ConvertLead
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/convertLead
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "leadId": "example-lead-id"
}

### Action: OpenDeal
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/openDeal
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "sample",
    "amount": 0
}

### Action: Archive
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/archive

### Action: OpenTicket
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/openTicket
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "subject": "sample"
}

### Action: Restore
POST http://localhost:5201/api/accounts/1/restore

